<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QBE plans 1-for-4 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QBE plans 1-for-4 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>QBE Insurance Group Ltd said on Monday it would make a one-for-four bonus issue.</p>
<p>QBE said it would issue about 56.75 million shares in the issue. This is the insurer's ninth bonus issue in the past 15 years.  </p>
<p>QBE earlier reported a net profit of A$147.3 million in the year to June 30, 1996 after movement in unrealised gains on investment.</p>
<p>This compares with A$82.5 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>QBE said the shares would be issued from the share premium reserve.</p>
<p>At 12.15 p.m. (0215 GMT), QBE shares were 19 cents firmer at A$7.79.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
